{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is approached, pick up and release object in object holder. Else, if obstacle, turn left and move. Finally, if object is visible, approach object or scan area for objects.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectHolder    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <Action ID = TurnLeft    /> <Action ID = MoveForward    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
